config: sensors triggered; bridge every 5000 us; run 20000 us
sample t=0 us (accel gen 1): accel_driver +50 sensors +30 estimator +200 dds_bridge +20 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 450 us
sample t=5000 us (accel gen 6): accel_driver +50 sensors +30 estimator +200 dds_bridge +20 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 450 us
sample t=10000 us (accel gen 11): accel_driver +50 sensors +30 estimator +200 dds_bridge +20 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 450 us
sample t=15000 us (accel gen 16): accel_driver +50 sensors +30 estimator +200 dds_bridge +20 ros2_listener +150  -> age at listener 450 us
latency added per hop (min..max over delivered samples):
  accel_driver: 50..50 us
  sensors: 30..30 us
  estimator: 200..200 us
  dds_bridge: 20..20 us
  ros2_listener: 150..150 us
age of the sample when the estimator finished: 280..280 us
accel samples published: 20; used by the estimator: 20; overwritten before sensors read them: 0
estimator outputs not forwarded (the bridge runs slower on purpose): 12
